      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-25T00:13:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well there is not a rule saying a heros card effect must resolve during their turn. There is nothing that would prevent DDA from resolving even if it was no longer scholars turn. This is not like a damage source being removed mid damage. That gets interrupted out of logical nessessity.&nbsp;</p><p>If scholars turn ends and those one shots are still in play, they resolve.&nbsp;</p>",
