      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-25T05:39:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To me this is similar to DDA being played out of turn. &nbsp;If this had all begun on some other player's turn (Argent Adept for instance), wouldn't you resolve them, even if something ended Argent Adept's turn prematurely? &nbsp;I'm firmly in the \"continue resolving DDA\" camp.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:19:56.210Z",
