      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>To me this is similar to DDA being played out of turn. &nbsp;If this had all begun on some other player&#39;s turn (Argent Adept for instance), wouldn&#39;t you resolve them, even if something ended Argent Adept&#39;s turn prematurely? &nbsp;I&#39;m firmly in the &quot;continue resolving DDA&quot; camp.</p>",
